  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TO54 Disability-Inclusive Ultra-Poor Graduation, Uganda 2021-22</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By 2022, our disability-inclusive ultra-poor graduation project will deliver increased socio-economic empowerment and resilience to 1,500 ultra-poor households (70% &amp; 15% of households respectively where the project holder is a woman and/or person with disability) in Western &amp; Northern regions of Uganda. Building evidence &amp; best practice will enable us to reach many more, contributing to sustainable poverty reduction (SDG1) &amp; reducing inequality (SDG 10) for the most marginalised &amp; vulnerable communities in Uganda and globally.</narrative>
  </description>
